{title: Great are you Lord}
{artist: Casting Crowns}
{key: A}

{comment: Strophe}
[D] [F#m] [E]
You give life, You are love
You bring light to the darkness
You give hope and You restore
Every heart that is broken

{comment: mini Bridge}
[D] [F#m] [E]
